WEBVTT

00:05:57.428 --> 00:06:00.182
And unfortunately,
this late stage of cancer

00:06:00.206 --> 00:06:04.166
is the one at which
it's most likely to be diagnosed,

00:06:04.190 --> 00:06:06.205
when angiogenesis is already turned on,

00:06:06.229 --> 00:06:08.793
and cancer cells are growing like wild.

00:06:09.737 --> 00:06:13.842
So, if angiogenesis is a tipping point

00:06:13.866 --> 00:06:16.976
between a harmless cancer
and a harmful one,

00:06:17.000 --> 00:06:20.274
then one major part
of the angiogenesis revolution

00:06:20.298 --> 00:06:22.053
is a new approach to treating cancer

00:06:22.077 --> 00:06:23.854
by cutting off the blood supply.

00:06:24.909 --> 00:06:28.117
We call this antiangiogenic therapy,

00:06:28.141 --> 00:06:30.419
and it's completely different
from chemotherapy,